# 9. Main Dashboard Components

## 9.1 Portfolio Mental State

The system converts the overall behavioural score into an entertaining status.

Possible states:

| Score  | State               |
| ------ | ------------------- |
| 0–20   | Zen Investor        |
| 21–40  | Mildly Questionable |
