# 20. Investment Intervention

### Priority

High-value stretch feature after the main dashboard.

Before confirming a BUY transaction, Portfolio Therapist analyses the hypothetical resulting portfolio.

Example:

```text
USER ATTEMPTS:

BUY 500 CBXT
```

System evaluates:

```text
Current CBXT exposure:    31%
Exposure after purchase:  46%
Recent CBXT return:       +18%
Previous purchases:       3
```

Display:

```text
PORTFOLIO THERAPIST INTERVENTION

You're about to buy another 500 CBXT.

CBXT currently represents 31% of your portfolio.
After this trade it would represent 46%.

CBXT has recently risen 18%.
You have already purchased it three times.
```

The system then asks:

```text
Why are you buying?

○ New information
○ Portfolio strategy
○ Valuation changed
○ It went up
○ Someone told me to
○ Vibes
```

If the user chooses:

```text
Vibes
```

the application may display:

```text
SESSION COMPLETE.

WE FOUND THE PROBLEM.
```

The intervention must remain informational and must not prevent the user from executing the trade.

