# 32. Product Vision

Portfolio Therapist should evolve from a funny hackathon feature into an explainable behavioural-finance layer that can sit above any transaction history.

The long-term architecture is:

```text
                    PORTFOLIO THERAPIST
                            │
             ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
             │                             │
      CASHBUX SIMULATION            EXTERNAL PORTFOLIO
             │                             │
     Existing transactions             CSV / API
             │                             │
             └──────────────┬──────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
                  Behaviour Analytics
                            │
                            ▼
                   Structured Evidence
                            │
                ┌───────────┴───────────┐
                │                       │
             Serious                  Roast
             Mode                     Mode
```

The product's central philosophy remains:

> **Don't ask AI whether someone is a bad investor. Measure their behaviour first, then let AI explain what the numbers already show.**
